 vides.","mood":"Noir presque total percé par une lanterne, ombres portées immenses, humidité.","imageUrl":"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20900%20600%22%20width%3D%22900%22%20height%3D%22600%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22900%22%20height%3D%22600%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(96%2C18%25%2C80%25)%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M0%20330%20L210%20236%20L400%20322%20L610%20220%20L900%20320%20L900%20600%20L0%20600%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(96%2C16%25%2C66%25)%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M0%20420%20L250%20356%20L520%20430%20L900%20370%20L900%20600%20L0%20600%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(96%2C18%25%2C52%25)%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M0%20508%20L320%20470%20L660%20520%20L900%20486%20L900%20600%20L0%20600%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(96%2C20%25%2C36%25)%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E","status":"completed"},{"id":"d4","name":"Le souvenir de 1943","importance":"figurant","type":"abstract","description":"Superposition de fragments : écriture manuscrite, timbre oblitéré, silhouette de femme à contre-jour, papier brûlé aux bords.","mood":"Sépia délavé, contours instables, tout est à demi effacé.","imageUrl":"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20900%20600%22%20width%3D%22900%22%20height%3D%22600%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22900%22%20height%3D%22600%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(42%2C18%25%2C80%25)%22%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%22700%22%20cy%3D%22150%22%20r%3D%2266%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(42%2C22%25%2C90%25)%22%20opacity%3D%220.9%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M0%20330%20L210%20236%20L400%20322%20L610%20220%20L900%20320%20L900%20600%20L0%20600%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(42%2C16%25%2C66%25)%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M0%20420%20L250%20356%20L520%20430%20L900%20370%20L900%20600%20L0%20600%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(42%2C18%25%2C52%25)%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M0%20508%20L320%20470%20L660%20520%20L900%20486%20L900%20600%20L0%20600%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(42%2C20%25%2C36%25)%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E","status":"completed"}],"scenes":[{"id":"s1","title":"L'ouverture de la maison","location":"La maison de la douane","environmentId":"d1","environmentDetail":"Salle basse aux murs chaulés, table de chêne massif, registre ouvert, lampe à pétrole, sol de dalles inégales, fenêtre à petits carreaux donnant sur la jetée.","description":"Maëlle pousse la porte restée fermée depuis la mort de Corentin et pose sa lampe sur la table.","originalTextExcerpt":"La pluie tombait sur Kervarec depuis onze jours. Maelle Trevidic remonta le\ncol de son cire et poussa la porte de la maison de la douane, dont personne\nn'avait tourne la clef depuis la mort du vieux Corentin. A l'interieur,\nl'odeur du sel et du bois mouille avait remplace celle du tabac.\n\nElle posa sa lampe sur la table. Le registre etait la, ouvert a la page du\ndouze novembre, et quelqu'un y avait ecrit apres lui.","charactersPresent":["Maëlle Trévidic"],"imageUrl":"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20900%20600%22%20width%3D%22900%22%20height%3D%22600%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22900%22%20height%3D%22600%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(30%2C18%25%2C78%25)%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M0%20392%20L900%20356%20L900%20600%20L0%20600%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(30%2C18%25%2C50%25)%22%2F%3E%3Cg%20transform%3D%22translate(330%2C0)%20scale(1)%20translate(-330%2C0)%22%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%22330%22%20cy%3D%22352%22%20r%3D%2234%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(30%2C22%25%2C26%25)%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M%20278%20600%20L%20290%20424%20Q%20330%20382%20370%20424%20L%20382%20600%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(30%2C22%25%2C26%25)%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3Cg%20transform%3D%22translate(576%2C0)%20scale(0.86)%20translate(-576%2C0)%22%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%22576%22%20cy%3D%22352%22%20r%3D%2234%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(30%2C22%25%2C26%25)%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M%20524%20600%20L%20536%20424%20Q%20576%20382%20616%20424%20L%20628%20600%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(30%2C22%25%2C26%25)%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%22864%22%20y%3D%22566%22%20font-family%3D%22monospace%22%20font-size%3D%2224%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(30%2C14%25%2C34%25)%22%20text-anchor%3D%22end%22%20opacity%3D%220.65%22%3EPL.%201%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E","status":"completed"},{"id":"s2","title":"Une écriture après la sienne","location":"La maison de la douane","environmentId":"d1","environmentDetail":"Salle basse aux murs chaulés, table de chêne massif, registre ouvert, lampe à pétrole, sol de dalles inégales, fenêtre à petits carreaux donnant sur la jetée.","description":"Penchée sur le registre, Maëlle découvre que quelqu'un a écrit après la dernière ligne du vieux douanier.","originalTextExcerpt":"Au matin, le brouillard avait mange la jetee. Ivan Bourdelot l'attendait\ndevant le phare, les mains dans les poches, avec cette facon qu'il avait de\nregarder la mer comme si elle lui devait de l'argent.\n\nRentre chez toi, dit-il. Cette histoire n'est pas la tienne.\n\nMaelle lui montra la page arrachee. Il ne la prit pas.","charactersPresent":["Maëlle Trévidic"],"imageUrl":"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20900%20600%22%20width%3D%22900%22%20height%3D%22600%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22900%22%20height%3D%22600%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(34%2C18%25%2C78%25)%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M0%20392%20L900%20356%20L900%20600%20L0%20600%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(34%2C18%25%2C50%25)%22%2F%3E%3Cg%20transform%3D%22translate(330%2C0)%20scale(1)%20translate(-330%2C0)%22%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%22330%22%20cy%3D%22352%22%20r%3D%2234%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(34%2C22%25%2C26%25)%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M%20278%20600%20L%20290%20424%20Q%20330%20382%20370%20424%20L%20382%20600%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(34%2C22%25%2C26%25)%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3Cg%20transform%3D%22translate(576%2C0)%20scale(0.86)%20translate(-576%2C0)%22%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%22576%22%20cy%3D%22352%22%20r%3D%2234%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(34%2C22%25%2C26%25)%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M%20524%20600%20L%20536%20424%20Q%20576%20382%20616%20424%20L%20628%20600%20Z%22%20fill%3D%22hsl(34%2C22%25%2C26%25)%22%2F%3E%